              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa nepuo nabo kata aalam lelo apa oojo pee epuonu aajur; neureshoyu sii ninye ilo kitok loo sikarini amu etayiolo ajo oloo Roma Paulo neidipaki aateen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.22.29",
